cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."
title: "YOLOv8 ROS 2 Jetson TensorRT Detector"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-04

authors:
  - given-names: "Nima"
    family-names: "Mahmoudi"

abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 Humble computer-vision detector optimized for NVIDIA Jetson,
  using YOLOv8 with TensorRT FP16/CUDA acceleration and supporting standalone
  and Docker deployments for real-time power-line tower head and body
  detection.

keywords:
  - ROS 2
  - YOLOv8
  - NVIDIA Jetson
  - TensorRT
  - CUDA
  - object detection
  - computer vision
  - tower inspection

repository-code: "https://github.com/nimahmoodi1/yolov8-ros2-jetson-tensorrt-detector"
